B.cj7=s(["Veraxi parses CycloneDX and SPDX JSON SBOMs alongside `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `package.json`, and `pubspec.yaml` with fail-closed version matching sorted by matched -> KEV -> EPSS.","Ingest Semgrep, Opengrep, Trivy, or CodeQL SARIF 2.1.0 `codeFlows` taint paths and Nuclei recon findings into Neo4j (`:SecurityFinding`) and Qdrant, cross-referenced against your indexed code graph."],t.s)
